":[{"s":1.6,"e":11.84,"text":"Metal door, no morning bell Somebody's brother breathin' in a sick cell"},{"s":13.78,"e":23.62,"text":"Port-au-Prince, can you hear that cry? 48 hours became 48 lives"},{"s":31.98,"e":36.42,"text":"They said the law, yeah, yeah"},{"s":36.52,"e":42.34,"text":"They said the law give 48 hours But the clock got swallowed by broken powers"},{"s":42.34,"e":47.3,"text":"No judge, no bread, no waterline Just bones in the dark doing borrowed time"},{"s":47.3,"e":52.44,"text":"Men sleep standing where the floor can't hold Heat on the skin, hunger in the soul"},{"s":52.44,"e":57.08,"text":"Some were guilty, some never tried But nobody deserves to be left inside"},{"s":57.08,"e":62.24,"text":"And they do bleed, hear us now There's a hell on earth behind those walls"},{"s":62.32,"e":68.24,"text":"Somehow, low man, you don't pay water Food at doctor's hand, a little mercy in a ruined land"},{"s":68.42,"e":73.9,"text":"American senators, presidents, congress, too Send modern speeches to the smoke and blue"},{"s":73.9,"e":79.08,"text":"In these acts of atrocity, open up the gate 48 hours should not become fate"},{"s":79.08,"e":84.02,"text":"No pain, breathe, no pain, stand Aiding the clinic, justice in the hand"},{"s":84.02,"e":89.62,"text":"For every brother in a cell, too sick to yell Pull one more soul from the mouth of hell"},{"s":89.62,"e":94.76,"text":"This ain't a song for saints only It's for the lost, the charged, the poor, the lonely"},{"s":94.96,"e":99.72,"text":"Misguided brothers, forgotten sons Still human when the daylight runs"},{"s":99.72,"e":104.82,"text":"If our man did wrong, let the courts be clear But don't bury him alive where no one hears"},{"s":104.82,"e":109.66,"text":"No trial, no medicine, no clean cup That's not justice, that's giving up"},{"s":110.4,"e":115.98,"text":"We are human too, not shadows For the world to lose, parkite your mori"},{"s":115.98,"e":119.84,"text":"Don't let them die, there's still a God under the sky"},{"s":120.04,"e":125.48,"text":"American senators, presidents, congress, too Send modern speeches to the smoke and blue"},{"s":125.48,"e":130.64,"text":"In these acts of atrocity, open up the gate 48 hours should not become fate"},{"s":130.64,"e":135.64,"text":"No pain, breathe, no pain, stand Aiding the clinic, justice in the hand"},{"s":135.64,"e":141.16,"text":"For every brother in a cell, too sick to yell Pull one more soul from the mouth of hell"},{"s":141.1,"e":146.24,"text":"No empire is holy if it looks away No flag is clean when children pray"},{"s":146.24,"e":151.32,"text":"For fathers behind bars with no bread in their hands While the world debates another rescue plan"},{"s":151.32,"e":156.46,"text":"Send doctors, send food, send courts that move Send water, send lights, send proof"},{"s":156.46,"e":162.04,"text":"Not another photo, not another prayer alone Make human dignity, policy, flesh and bone"},{"s":162.04,"e":167.02,"text":"Deal out water, manger, food Doctor, doctors, justice"},{"s":167.02,"e":169.74,"text":"Justice, justice, justice, justice"},{"s":171.78,"e":177.42,"text":"48 hours, not 48 praise 48 hours, let somebody say"},{"s":177.42,"e":181.8,"text":"48 hours, hear the prison bell 48 hours, from hell"},{"s":181.8,"e":187.46,"text":"American senators, presidents, congress, too There are things only power can choose to do"},{"s":187.46,"e":192.64,"text":"In these acts of atrocity, answer the call A nation is judged by the least of all"},{"s":192.6,"e":197.58,"text":"No pain, breathe, no pain, stand Aiding the clinic, justice in the hand"},{"s":197.58,"e":203.32,"text":"For every brother in a cell, too sick to yell Pull one more soul from the mouth of hell"},{"s":204.58,"e":209.72,"text":"Haiti, Haiti, yeah, Haiti, right No pabli, we won't forget"},{"s":209.72,"e":218.72,"text":"Behind those walls, somebody's still seen Open the door, let mercy in"},{"s":222.28,"e":222.36,"text":"Oh-oh"}],"duration":227.96,"source":"whisper-aligned","generatedAt":"2026-06-17T13:11:31.549Z","stats":{"whisperWords":516,"polishedWords":513,"matched":510,"matchRate":0.994}}